--- DATA NOTICE ---

The MIT licence above covers the SOFTWARE (the fetch/build/verify pipeline and the dashboard code).

The DATA published in api/ and dashboard/ is compiled from public Reserve Bank of India publications
and is reproduced here with attribution, for research and educational use. It is:
  * NOT an official Reserve Bank of India product and is not endorsed by or affiliated with the RBI;
  * NOT warranted to be accurate, complete or current - the publisher revises figures without notice;
  * NOT a substitute for the primary source. Verify anything you rely on at https://data.rbi.org.in/.

If you reuse the data, attribute the Reserve Bank of India as the source and link to the relevant
publication. Definitions reproduced in api/v1/definitions.json remain the words of their publishers
(RBI, MoSPI/NSO, DPIIT and FBIL) and are quoted for identification only.
